  "message": "No runtime tests ran (0 checks), so I can't validate any part of this design yet. All 8 components are blocked because there's no supported generator for Event Hubs, Functions, Azure ML, Cosmos DB or Monitor in this flow. That's product engineering work, not a mistake in your design, and the fix isn't to shrink the app down to just storage.\n\nThe quarantine Blob container looks like it fits the private-object-storage contract, but it's only half wired. To use that contract, we'd need an identity that can write to and read from the container. Do you want the validation function to write rejected events there, or should an existing operator identity read and replay them? Your answer decides which access contract we draw.",
